lemex --worktree setup: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `lemex fork`, `lemex exec`, and `lemex exec fork`
lemex fork --worktree: `lemex fork --worktree` requires an explicit session ID
lemex fork --worktree --last: `lemex fork --worktree` requires an explicit session ID
lemex exec resume --worktree session: `--worktree` cannot resume an existing session; use `lemex exec fork --worktree`
